WEBVTT

00:15.326 --> 00:17.671
Huh?
啊？

00:17.671 --> 00:20.981
Avast, keep your proposal
and propaganda mitts
Avast，保留您的建议
和宣传手套

00:20.981 --> 00:22.464
away from me door!
离我门远点！

00:22.464 --> 00:25.636
Come on, man,
I'm just doing my job.
来吧，伙计，
我只是在做我的工作。

00:29.360 --> 00:30.740
"Come one, come all
“一个来，大家都来

00:30.740 --> 00:33.878
to the Big Bikini Bottom
Parade tomorrow."
到大比基尼底部
明天游行。”

00:33.878 --> 00:35.981
Oh, boy!
哦，孩子！

00:35.981 --> 00:38.740
Parade?
游行？

00:38.740 --> 00:42.257
I did enough marching
when I was in the navy.
我行军够多了
当我在海军时。

00:42.257 --> 00:44.119
Ooh, but a parade
is a great way
哦，但是游行
是个好方法

00:44.119 --> 00:46.740
to get free advertising
for the Krusty--
获得免费广告
对于库斯蒂来说——

00:46.740 --> 00:48.085
Free?
自由的？

00:48.085 --> 00:50.050
That's me favorite assemblage
of letters.
这是我最喜欢的组合
字母。

00:50.050 --> 00:51.292
What do we do?
我们该怎么办？

00:51.292 --> 00:53.671
We're gonna have
to build a float.
我们将会有
建造一个漂浮物。

00:53.671 --> 00:54.912
Hmm.
唔。

00:54.912 --> 00:57.119
Well, that was another day wasted.
好吧，又浪费了一天。

00:57.119 --> 00:59.154
Your day's not over,
Mr. Squidward.
你的一天还没有结束
章鱼哥先生。

00:59.154 --> 01:00.498
I want you and SpongeBob
我想要你和海绵宝宝

01:00.498 --> 01:02.154
to build a Krusty Krab float
制作蟹堡王浮标

01:02.154 --> 01:04.085
for the Bikini Bottom Parade tomorrow.
参加明天的比基尼泳装游行。

01:04.085 --> 01:05.360
Oh, yeah!
哦，是啊！

01:09.154 --> 01:11.567
You two have ten hours.
你们两个还有十个小时。

01:11.567 --> 01:15.257
And since you're the artistic
type, you get to design it.
既然你是艺术界的
类型，你就可以设计它。

01:15.257 --> 01:17.360
Design? Okay!
设计？好的！

01:17.360 --> 01:19.740
Wait, what's the budget?
等等，预算是多少？

01:19.740 --> 01:23.498
Well, that's the best part.
Zero budget.
嗯，这是最好的部分。
零预算。

01:23.498 --> 01:27.981
You get to be creative
and use your imagerination.
你要有创意
并运用你的想象。

01:27.981 --> 01:31.223
Imagination.
想像力。

01:33.705 --> 01:35.981
Can't wait
to see your masterpiece.
等不及了
来看看你的杰作。

01:35.981 --> 01:38.498
Have fun, you two.
玩得开心，你们两个。

01:38.498 --> 01:41.498
- Mm-hmm.
- Whatcha drawing? Lemme see.
- 嗯嗯。
- 画什么？让我看看。

01:41.498 --> 01:43.188
I wanna see. I wanna see.
我想看看。我想看看。

01:43.188 --> 01:44.843
I wanna see.
Come on, show me.
我想看看。
来吧，给我看看。

01:44.843 --> 01:46.257
Can I see? Can I see?
我可以看吗？我可以看吗？

01:46.257 --> 01:47.292
I wanna see.
我想看看。

01:47.292 --> 01:49.326
Please? Huh?
请？啊？

01:49.326 --> 01:51.016
Whoa!
- Go ahead.
哇！
- 前进。

01:51.016 --> 01:52.360
Tell me how much you like it.
告诉我你有多喜欢它。

01:52.360 --> 01:54.498
Don't worry, I can take it.
别担心，我能承受。

01:54.498 --> 01:56.809
First of all, it's genius.
首先，它是天才。

01:57.809 --> 01:59.912
But it could use a little--
但它可以用一点——

01:59.912 --> 02:01.912
Just build it!
建造它吧！

02:06.809 --> 02:09.464
What the?
什么？

02:09.464 --> 02:12.809
Squidward, where do I find
building materials?
章鱼哥，我在哪里可以找到
建筑材料？

02:12.809 --> 02:14.188
I don't care!
我不在乎！

02:14.188 --> 02:16.016
Anywhere!
任何地方！

02:18.533 --> 02:21.705
Of course.
当然。

02:25.292 --> 02:27.636
"I don't care, anywhere."
“我不在乎，无论在哪里。”

02:27.636 --> 02:30.705
What?
什么？

02:30.705 --> 02:32.843
Hello, anywhere.
你好，无论在哪里。

02:37.740 --> 02:41.223
D--aah!
啊——啊！

02:41.223 --> 02:42.740
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

02:42.740 --> 02:44.843
You know, you look like
a little baby octopus
你知道吗，你看起来像
一只小章鱼宝宝

02:44.843 --> 02:46.395
when you're asleep.
当你睡着的时候。

02:46.395 --> 02:47.947
What time is it?
现在是几奌？

02:47.947 --> 02:49.395
Almost parade time.
快到游行时间了。

02:49.395 --> 02:50.705
I finished it.
我完成了。

02:50.705 --> 02:53.671
I give you
the Krusty Krab parade float.
我给你
蟹堡王游行花车。

02:53.671 --> 02:55.326
Ta-da!
哒哒！

02:55.326 --> 02:57.429
I made it a little more
on theme.
我又做了一点
关于主题。

02:57.429 --> 02:59.705
It's moron-themed, all right.
这是白痴主题，好吧。

02:59.705 --> 03:01.843
You didn't even use my drawing.
你连我的图都没用过。

03:01.843 --> 03:03.326
Of course, I did.
当然，我做到了。

03:03.326 --> 03:06.981
I used it to patch up that hole
in the Krabby Patty.
我用它来修补那个洞
在蟹肉饼里。

03:06.981 --> 03:10.119
Well, whatever.
好吧，无论如何。

03:10.119 --> 03:11.843
It looks fine, I guess.
我想看起来不错。

03:11.843 --> 03:13.981
The secret formula bottle
almost looks
秘密配方瓶
几乎看起来

03:13.981 --> 03:15.326
like the real thing.
就像真实的东西一样。

03:15.326 --> 03:17.257
It is, just bigger.
是的，只是更大。

03:17.257 --> 03:20.671
I even wrote down the secret
formula on the paper inside.
我什至写下了这个秘密
里面的纸上有公式。

03:20.671 --> 03:23.843
Only we know.
只有我们知道。

03:23.843 --> 03:27.119
I even wrote down the secret
formula on the paper inside.
我什至写下了这个秘密
里面的纸上有公式。

03:28.878 --> 03:30.360
<i>Only we know.</i>
<i>只有我们知道。</i>

03:30.360 --> 03:33.223
Wrote down
the secret formula?
写下来
秘密公式？

03:33.223 --> 03:36.429
That beautiful idiot!
那个美丽的白痴！

03:36.429 --> 03:40.878
Looks like I'm going
to a parade.
看来我要去
去游行。

03:40.878 --> 03:44.740
<i>Welcome to the annual
Bikini Bottom Parade,</i>
<i>欢迎来到一年一度的
比基尼泳裤游行，</i>

03:44.740 --> 03:48.395
<i>and it's a beautiful ocean day
for it.</i>
<i>这是一个美丽的海洋日
为了它。</i>

03:48.395 --> 03:51.809
<i>I'm Perch Perkins, coming
to you live from downtown.</i>
<i>我是 Perch Perkins，来了
你住在市中心。</i>

03:51.809 --> 03:54.464
And with me
is this year's co-host,
和我一起
是今年的联合主持人，

03:54.464 --> 03:57.705
the one and only
Ice Cream King.
唯一的
冰淇淋王。

03:57.705 --> 03:59.740
It's an honor to have you,
Your Majesty.
很荣幸有你
陛下。

03:59.740 --> 04:02.533
Do I call you King or Ice?
我该叫你国王还是冰？

04:02.533 --> 04:04.567
Hey, you're that guy!
嘿，你就是那个人！

04:04.567 --> 04:08.326
How'd you get out of my TV,
you bad little boy?
你怎么从我的电视里出来了
你是坏小子吗？

04:08.326 --> 04:11.085
Ooh, you're wearing makeup!
哦，你化妆了！

04:11.085 --> 04:12.533
Are you a cloud?
你是一朵云吗？

04:12.533 --> 04:14.498
I want a balloon.
- Uh, yeah. Yeah, yeah, sure.
我想要一个气球。
- 呃，是的。是的，是的，当然。

04:14.498 --> 04:16.119
We'll get you a balloon.
我们会给你一个气球。

04:17.360 --> 04:19.498
<i>And to kick off
this year's parade</i>
<i>然后开始
今年的游行</i>

04:19.498 --> 04:24.085
<i>here comes the Bikini Bottom
High School marching band.</i>
<i>比基尼泳裤来了
高中军乐队。</i>

04:24.085 --> 04:25.912
<i>You know, even when
they're not playing,</i>
<i>你知道，即使
他们没有玩，</i>

04:25.912 --> 04:28.912
<i>they love to march together.</i>
<i>他们喜欢一起游行。</i>

04:28.912 --> 04:33.774
<i>The band is actually made up
of 35 individual bands.</i>
<i>乐队实际上已经组成了
35 个独立乐队。</i>

04:33.774 --> 04:36.981
<i>Amazing precision
from these youngsters!</i>
<i>惊人的精度
来自这些年轻人！</i>

04:36.981 --> 04:39.671
<i>They all wore
the same outfit.</i>
<i>他们都穿着
一样的衣服。</i>

04:39.671 --> 04:41.671
<i>How embarrassing.</i>
<i>多么尴尬。</i>

04:41.671 --> 04:44.809
<i>Oh, a perfect jellyfish!</i>
<i>哦，完美的水母！</i>

04:44.809 --> 04:46.395
<i>That's a jellyfish?</i>
<i>那是水母吗？</i>

04:46.395 --> 04:48.740
<i>I was gonna say a clump
of hair.</i>
<i>我本来想说一团
头发。</i>

04:48.740 --> 04:51.085
<i>Wait, did that kid
just separate</i>
<i>等等，那孩子是吗？
只是分开</i>

04:51.085 --> 04:54.947
<i>into two organisms
via binary fission?</i>
<i>分成两个有机体
通过二元裂变？</i>

04:54.947 --> 04:56.636
<i>I've been bicycle fishing.</i>
<i>我一直在骑自行车钓鱼。</i>

04:56.636 --> 04:59.016
<i>It really hurts.</i>
<i>真的很痛。</i>

05:01.981 --> 05:04.567
Aren't those kids amazing?
那些孩子们是不是很了不起？

05:04.567 --> 05:07.464
<i>And what have we here?</i>
<i>我们这里有什么？</i>

05:07.464 --> 05:09.981
It's the kooky Nitwitting Club.
这是古怪的 Nitwitting 俱乐部。

05:15.774 --> 05:20.464
<i>Okay, the Ice Cream King has
joined his fellow Nitwitters.</i>
<i>好的，冰淇淋大王有
加入了他的 Nitwitters 同胞。</i>

05:20.464 --> 05:24.292
Whoa, I've never seen anyone
drive like that before!
哇，我从来没有见过任何人
以前也是这么开车的！

05:28.119 --> 05:29.292
Any minute now,
现在任何一分钟，

05:29.292 --> 05:32.498
that secret formula
will be mine.
那个秘密公式
将是我的。

05:32.498 --> 05:36.257
Ow, ow, ow, ow,
ow, ow, ow, ow!
噢，噢，噢，噢，
噢，噢，噢，噢！

05:39.602 --> 05:41.085
Boy, after seeing this float,
男孩，看到这个漂浮物后，

05:41.085 --> 05:43.223
everyone will rush
to the Krusty Krab.
每个人都会冲
到蟹堡王。

05:43.223 --> 05:46.498
How ya set up with those
expired fries, boy-o?
你如何设置这些
薯条过期了，男孩？

05:46.498 --> 05:50.257
Good and greasy, boss.
好又油腻，老板。

05:50.257 --> 05:53.119
- Ready, Mr. Squidward?
- No, I'm not.
- 准备好了吗，章鱼哥先生？
- 不，我不是。

05:53.119 --> 05:56.223
I can't see a thing
with SpongeBob in front of me.
我什么也看不见
海绵宝宝在我面前。

05:56.223 --> 05:57.326
Excellent!
出色的！

05:57.326 --> 05:58.567
It's our turn.
轮到我们了。

05:58.567 --> 06:01.429
Let's move it out!
我们把它搬出去吧！

06:07.257 --> 06:09.705
<i>Next up we have
the Beefy Bros</i>
<i>接下来我们有
强壮兄弟</i>

06:09.705 --> 06:11.878
<i>from Larry's Gym.</i>
<i>来自拉里的健身房。</i>

06:11.878 --> 06:15.395
<i>Whoa, look at those meatheads
pump iron.</i>
<i>哇哦，看看那些笨蛋
泵熨斗。</i>

06:15.395 --> 06:18.878
<i>That's some impressive
muscle hustle.</i>
<i>这令人印象深刻
肌肉的忙碌。</i>

06:18.878 --> 06:20.429
<i>And here comes Mrs. Puff.</i>
<i>帕芙夫人来了。</i>

06:20.429 --> 06:23.395
<i>Oh, as her own balloon!</i>
<i>哦，作为她自己的气球！</i>

06:23.395 --> 06:26.636
<i>Whoa, I want that balloon!</i>
<i>哇，我想要那个气球！</i>

06:26.636 --> 06:30.395
<i>Patrick's rock is one float
that doesn't float.</i>
<i>帕特里克的岩石是一个漂浮物
不会漂浮。</i>

06:30.395 --> 06:32.395
Aah!
啊啊！

06:32.395 --> 06:35.740
<i>Oh, looks like Bubble Bass
has hitched a ride</i>
<i>哦，看起来像泡泡鲈
已搭便车</i>

06:35.740 --> 06:38.636
<i>with Mermaid Man
and Barnacle Boy.</i>
<i>与美人鱼人
和藤壶男孩。</i>

06:38.636 --> 06:40.188
<i>And what's this?</i>
<i>这是什么？</i>

06:40.188 --> 06:41.912
<i>Not to be outdone,</i>
<i>不甘示弱，</i>

06:41.912 --> 06:46.223
<i>it's Fred in his incredible
My Leg Mobile.</i>
<i>这是弗雷德在他令人难以置信的
我的腿移动。</i>

06:46.223 --> 06:48.464
My leg! My leg!
我的腿！我的腿！

06:48.464 --> 06:51.223
I'm in my leg!
我在我腿上！

06:53.464 --> 06:54.912
I smell grease.
我闻到了油脂味。

06:54.912 --> 06:57.119
Oh, that's not me
you're smelling, King.
哦，那不是我
你闻起来很臭，国王。

06:57.119 --> 07:00.636
It's the float
from the Krusty Krab,
这是浮标
来自蟹堡王，

07:00.636 --> 07:03.223
<i>serving over a million Krabby Patties</i>
<i>提供超过一百万个蟹黄饼</i>

07:03.223 --> 07:06.085
<i>daily to hundreds.</i>
- Whoo-hoo! Hey!
<i>每天数百人。</i>
- 呼呼！嘿！

07:06.085 --> 07:08.947
<i>Oh, there's everybody's
favorite tightwad...</i>
<i>哦，每个人都有
最喜欢的小气鬼...</i>

07:08.947 --> 07:11.223
<i>Mr. Krabs.</i>
<i>先生。螃蟹。</i>

07:11.223 --> 07:15.360
<i>Well, there's something new--
french-fry confetti.</i>
<i>嗯，有一些新东西——
炸薯条五彩纸屑。</i>

07:15.360 --> 07:17.705
all: Ow.
允许。

07:22.809 --> 07:26.360
Time to meet your doom, Krabs.
是时候迎接你的厄运了，蟹蟹。

07:29.636 --> 07:33.912
Secret formula
at 12:00.
秘密配方
12:00。

07:33.912 --> 07:36.602
<i>Hang on, folks.
It looks like the parade's got</i>
<i>等一下，伙计们。
看起来游行已经开始了</i>

07:36.602 --> 07:38.395
<i>a last-minute entry.</i>
<i>最后一刻的条目。</i>

07:38.395 --> 07:42.809
I'd say it's some kind of
rancid hot dog on wheels?
我想说这是某种
轮子上的腐臭热狗？

07:42.809 --> 07:44.809
<i>No, folks.</i>
<i>不，伙计们。</i>

07:44.809 --> 07:46.912
<i>I believe
this is Bikini Bottom's</i>
<i>我相信
这是比基尼泳裤的</i>

07:46.912 --> 07:49.464
<i>own evil genius, Plankton.</i>
<i>自己的邪恶天才，浮游生物。</i>

07:49.464 --> 07:51.671
- Whoa!
<i>- Oh! [laughs]</i>
- 哇！
<i>-哦！ [笑]</i>

07:51.671 --> 07:52.947
- Whoa!
<i>- It didn't take long</i>
- 哇！
<i>- 没花多久</i>

07:52.947 --> 07:54.878
<i>for anarchy
to begin this year.</i>
<i>为了无政府状态
从今年开始。</i>

07:54.878 --> 07:59.878
It's a rogue wave,
a nor'easter, a perfect storm!
这是一波无赖的浪潮，
东北，一场完美的风暴！

07:59.878 --> 08:02.360
<i>Oh, it's chaos
and confusion,</i>
<i>哦，这很混乱
和混乱，</i>

08:02.360 --> 08:06.395
<i>a tradition here
at the Bikini Bottom Parade.</i>
<i>这里的传统
在比基尼泳裤游行中。</i>

08:06.395 --> 08:08.119
- Yah!
- Aah!
- 啊！
- 啊啊！

08:08.119 --> 08:09.981
Aah!
啊啊！

08:09.981 --> 08:13.429
<i>Well, looks like there
is something new on the menu.</i>
<i>嗯，看起来像那里
菜单上有新东西。</i>

08:13.429 --> 08:14.947
Ow.
噢。

08:14.947 --> 08:18.223
<i>The Krusty Krab float
is coming in hot!</i>
<i>蟹堡浮车
即将火爆登场！</i>

08:18.223 --> 08:20.774
My leg!
我的腿！

08:20.774 --> 08:22.636
My Leg Mobile!
我的腿移动！

08:22.636 --> 08:26.774
<i>And here we see
the domino effect in action.</i>
<i>在这里我们看到
多米诺骨牌效应正在发挥作用。</i>

08:28.464 --> 08:30.188
Huh? Oh.
啊？哦。

08:30.188 --> 08:32.223
My champion.
我的冠军。

08:32.223 --> 08:35.602
Larry can't lift
this kind of weight.
拉里举不起来
这种重量。

08:38.464 --> 08:41.085
<i>Ladies and gentlemen,
this parade has careened</i>
<i>女士们、先生们，
这场游行倾斜了</i>

08:41.085 --> 08:43.188
<i>into a calamitous catastrophe</i>
<i>陷入灾难</i>

08:43.188 --> 08:46.360
<i>of crashing and chaos.</i>
<i>崩溃和混乱。</i>

08:46.360 --> 08:50.843
Baby wants his secret formula!
宝宝想要他的秘密配方奶粉！

08:50.843 --> 08:52.705
Aah!
啊啊！

08:52.705 --> 08:54.292
Oh, no, no, no, no, no, no.
哦，不，不，不，不，不，不。

08:54.292 --> 08:56.188
No, Plankton.
No, Plankton. No, no!
不，浮游生物。
不，浮游生物。不，不！

08:59.326 --> 09:01.705
Whoo-hoo!
呼呼！

09:01.705 --> 09:03.843
Abandon float!
放弃浮动！

09:03.843 --> 09:06.154
Whoa!
- Aah!
哇！
- 啊啊！

09:06.154 --> 09:08.154
Wait for me!
等我！

09:17.602 --> 09:20.188
It's mine. It's mine!
这是我的。这是我的！

09:22.429 --> 09:23.912
Hmm, why does he want
嗯，他为什么要

09:23.912 --> 09:25.774
that useless prop, anyway?
无论如何，那个无用的道具？

09:25.774 --> 09:29.257
Because SpongeBob wrote
the secret formula
因为海绵宝宝写道
秘密公式

09:29.257 --> 09:31.360
on that paper.
在那张纸上。

09:31.360 --> 09:32.498
Wait, what? What?
等等，什么？什么？

09:32.498 --> 09:35.257
What?
什么？

09:37.533 --> 09:40.602
<i>It looks like one last float
from the local gas station</i>
<i>看起来像是最后一个漂浮物
从当地加油站出发</i>

09:40.602 --> 09:44.223
<i>is making a combustible entry.</i>
<i>正在形成可燃入口。</i>

09:45.498 --> 09:48.154
<i>Well folks,
this parade has now</i>
<i>各位，
这次游行现在已经</i>

09:48.154 --> 09:51.429
<i>officially been declared
an apocalypse.</i>
<i>已正式宣布
一场启示录。</i>

09:55.636 --> 09:57.498
No, no!
不，不！

09:57.498 --> 09:59.395
I almost had it!
我差点就拥有了！

09:59.395 --> 10:01.947
Come on, boy-o.
来吧，男孩。

10:01.947 --> 10:03.947
Let's go back
to the Krusty Krab,
我们回去吧
到蟹堡王，

10:03.947 --> 10:06.533
where I can punish you proper
with unpaid overtime
我可以适当惩罚你
有无薪加班

10:06.533 --> 10:08.188
for doing such a foolish thing.
因为做了这么愚蠢的事。

10:08.188 --> 10:09.636
Yay!
耶！

10:09.636 --> 10:13.085
Aha! I got something--
啊哈！我得到了一些东西——

10:13.085 --> 10:16.395
an ingredient
to the secret formula.
一种成分
到秘密公式。

10:16.395 --> 10:19.395
I got an ingredient.
我得到了一种成分。

10:19.395 --> 10:22.498
Hmm. Salt.
唔。盐。

10:22.498 --> 10:25.498
That's right, baby. Salt!
没错，宝贝。盐！

10:25.498 --> 10:27.740
It's got salt in it.
里面有盐。

10:27.740 --> 10:30.016
I'm cracking the code!
我正在破解密码！

10:30.016 --> 10:32.705
All I have to do now is
add the right ingredients
我现在要做的就是
添加正确的成分

10:32.705 --> 10:35.498
to salt, and voilà!
加盐，瞧！

10:35.498 --> 10:37.878
I'll have the Krabby Patty
secret formula.
我要一份蟹肉饼
秘密配方。

10:37.878 --> 10:39.602
You know, I really am a genius.
你知道，我真的是个天才。

10:39.602 --> 10:40.912
Well folks,
好吧，各位，

10:40.912 --> 10:44.912
another Bikini Bottom Parade
ends in disaster.
另一场比基尼泳装游行
以灾难告终。

10:44.912 --> 10:48.154
- Oh.
- Same as every year.
- 哦。
- 每年都一样。

10:48.154 --> 10:49.740
Ah, why not?
啊，为什么不呢？

10:49.740 --> 10:54.050
And now, I'd like to thank
my co-host, the Ice Cream King.
现在，我要感谢
我的搭档主持人，冰淇淋大王。

10:54.050 --> 10:55.912
Hey, King?
嘿，国王？

10:55.912 --> 10:59.257
- King?
- I got my balloon!
- 国王？
- 我拿到了我的气球！

- 国王？
- 我拿到了我的气球！